{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "0c0d2c26d197edb8d18f5deff9ebc90d1d13e2ef36863858137e71b725c206bb", "ja": "月明かりのファンデーション", "zh": "月光粉底", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e1bca789ebbfa1f1bc4c0f4c25013a30760dcbb7a590455022bdeee29fcebafc", "ja": "夜の海辺にやってきた一同。焦っていた紗代\r\n子も、綺麗な夜景に心を落ち着かせる。その\r\n横顔が大人びて見える、と言うジュリア。シ\r\nチュエーションで雰囲気は変わる、とのプロ\r\nデューサーの言葉に、気付きを得る一同。", "zh": "来到夜晚海边的一行人。原本焦躁不安的纱代\n子，也在这美丽的夜景中平静下来。茱莉亚说\n她的侧脸看起来成熟了不少。而在听到制作人说\n“情境能改变一个人的气质”后，大家都有所领悟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0b59e2622e90a8c9e8e6e71b0471edbf6355bbbb2b31d49f78029565a32a4c72", "ja": "（アクアリウスの3人と、夜の海辺を歩いている。\nいい気分転換になるといいけど……）", "zh": "（和水瓶座的3个人一起走在夜晚的海边。希望这样能让她转换一下心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "978daed9604ce11fb9f06a089c55f77696b65486139ba4448806cb199c14d6f6", "ja": "紗代子、せっかくだから、顔をあげて歩かないか？", "zh": "纱代子，难得有这个机会，要不要抬起头走走？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "2424d04c3931a098be10b8bb88b1c1a1fbe01f6241969778bd722512f6822bdd", "ja": "で、でも{$P$}。\n私、どうすればいいか、わからないままで……。", "zh": "可、可是{$P$}。\n我还是不知道该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "b5471dd7db2d93391a96541a2d8261f340736e8cdbaba650bdbfa3057c0f8448", "ja": "何かしてないと、落ち着かないんです。\n……やっぱり劇場に戻ろうかな……。", "zh": "要是不做点什么，我就静不下心来。\n……我还是回剧场去吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "93d55ee46ad60192c60906d795e523f8ee51ba40ebe74a4dcfe1ae7781349747", "ja": "ふふっ、紗代子ちゃん♪　見て見て、ひろーい夜空！\n気持ちいいね。ヤッホー！", "zh": "呵呵，纱代子♪你看你看，好宽广的夜空！\n真舒服啊。呀吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "e1cabe5796fd5361dc1f1e3a2949ec3f02b2f008aa65de26de8439320ce33fd6", "ja": "レイ、海でヤッホーはないだろ。\n……でも、本当にいい眺めだ。ほら、サヨ。", "zh": "丽，你在海边喊什么“呀吼”啊。\n……不过，景色真的很不错。你看，纱代。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "b4826f644629598f9306669163dc3bd7c0f152757104593b0122db31850776d3", "ja": "う、うん……。\nあ、ほんとだ。綺麗な夜景……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……。\n啊，真的耶。好漂亮的夜景……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "af7afd4810cdb8de3c64110cb8d551fea9942d6719ad83c4d5bfa8a724a89187", "ja": "……それに、風も。\n気持ちいい……。", "zh": "……而且，风吹着也……\n好舒服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "246ae5ac1e5374389ee430315dc506fb24e58c0eec1cb10290781ea2742a2344", "ja": "サヨ、そうしてると、なんか……。\n大人っぽい。", "zh": "纱代，你这样子，总觉得……\n很成熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "a937fc237065b8091f4fef180643e0815016cec9b20ae9f60f6fe9eb0b3b8ba9", "ja": "なんつーか、キレイになった感じがする……\nって、あたしは何言ってるんだ？　ははっ。", "zh": "该怎么说呢，总觉得变漂亮了……\n呃，我在说什么啊？哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "bf3cd3eb23190ac641cf49d0c9df105b130c12fac82119d629f5fe48b0af9d8a", "ja": "ちょ……ジュリア？　いきなり、そんな……\nもうっ、からかわないでっ！", "zh": "等……茱莉亚？突然说这种话……真是的，别逗我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "7776633c2523038c7cbdcdfe3a3ccee059762576c54f85678a9135fd21c32e82", "ja": "ううん、紗代子ちゃん、本当にキレイ！\nお月様の光が、ぽわーって髪に当たって♪", "zh": "没有哦，纱代子，真的好美！\n月光照在你的头发上，柔柔地晕开来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "0dc5fe708bee11f25c1c3cfb105364d4c45f35e265545617f6596286bcb09c68", "ja": "それに、ジュリアちゃんもキレイだよ？\n横顔がスワッ！って感じ！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "而且，茱莉亚也很漂亮哦？侧脸有种“唰！”的感觉！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "104d671b1e8285e971ca871a684b282fa9df00825ab59f3d71790b74771347c0", "ja": "なっ！？　れ、レイ、あたしはいいんだよ！\nだいたい、スワッってなんだよ……。", "zh": "什么！？丽、丽花，我就算了！\n话说回来，“唰”到底是什么意思啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3985bfacee248d8698d45e6477ebce2df061167114bedc546950446da444246d", "ja": "でも、麗花のいう通りだと思うな。ふたりとも……\nいや、麗花も。みんな大人っぽく見えるよ。", "zh": "不过，我觉得丽花说得没错。你们两个……\n不，丽花也是。大家看起来都很成熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "f9e52d47a645a9067e8565f17e2ac74f4aab6b7247232f3bac33b4afd2e32ad7", "ja": "あんたまで、なに言ってんだ？\nああもう、ムズムズする！", "zh": "怎么连你也跟着瞎说啊？\n啊真是的，浑身都不自在了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "cf42dbac27c2f4a222616ebb1ec3401c023dddad04756090b5306e4777acbf3c", "ja": "あ、そういえば！　{$P$}さんも、\nいつもよりずっと普通に見えますよ♪", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生看起来也比平时普通多了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3463f6e726681bd771cb353c2380bc2b659dd2a8f18c0ba60ea526c934c4a529", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか？　そうか……。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "1af748954e6c70c307295cc9017abcd902076137e245b91d43ec933ef53c7c61", "ja": "でもでも、私たち、夜景を見ていただけですよね？　\nうーん、どうしてなんでしょう？", "zh": "不过不过，我们只是来欣赏夜景的吧？\n嗯——为什么会这样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d0a68d7dedf979af8e27481650b28fc7ad343c041dd454cedc39593fe76dce3d", "ja": "そうだな……。場所やシチュエーションで、\n雰囲気は変わる。……変えられると思う。", "zh": "是啊……场所和情境不同，氛围也会改变。我觉得……氛围是可以改变的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d6f17f99697485e61f163022994e4c2745e5d854c741781c54f0be6cc836e5da", "ja": "ほら、みんなのステージも、ライトの色ひとつで\n雰囲気が変わるし。表現できることも増えるだろ？", "zh": "你看，大家的舞台也会因为灯光颜色的变化而改变氛围。能表现出来的东西也会变多，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4abcb530ec1b0c3c858bb8daaad90d928c3841e828cf13ce3d0f5b4b1e6a4ce0", "ja": "角度を変えただけで、表情も違って見えたり、真逆の\n情感になったり。……歌い方にも言えることかもな。", "zh": "只是换个角度，表情看起来就截然不同，情感也会完全相反。……唱歌的方式也是一样的道理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "4a4e019cfe5a678df38d0b1633876f0d6bfbfaea3b750bc37cefa1b5312c367f", "ja": "歌い方……。", "zh": "唱歌的方式……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "cc683b21705f3c403fb8510f68a588f976c6e9a9ef4556eee180fd4cde0521c5", "ja": "私たちが変わらなくても、変われる……。\n変えられる……？", "zh": "就算我们自己没有改变，也能……变化……。\n能被改变……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a2e164bf6dc8ffdd284039febf619b2610514c5827bb09d6b9ee06be1b1f02f", "ja": "なあ、今のってもしかして、\n大事なコトじゃないか？", "zh": "喂，刚才那个，说不定是很重要的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "7b7f39dc55d8bf0d8cbe2000c99fbf1c07e94f75360071ec3f38e227f1f45868", "ja": "う、うん、なにか……つかめた気がする。\n忘れないようにしなきゃ！", "zh": "嗯、嗯，感觉好像……抓住什么诀窍了。\n可不能忘记了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "8f478d894458f8db33241482ec89c6f96604a8bc104b9534a88e4738fc5e66a2", "ja": "{$P$}、いいこと言うじゃないか！\nあんた、ずっと夜の海辺にいた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "{$P$}，你这话说得不错嘛！  \n你是不是一直待在夜晚的海边比较好啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d657428876449cdac77764b46bfeb7be15777ab90a39bcb747fcd6f5c1891ab1", "ja": "え？　いや、今のは別に、場所やシチュエーションの\nおかげで言えたとかじゃないぞ？", "zh": "诶？不，刚才那话可不是因为地点或情境合适才说得出来的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "deb2fcdae78c4b980581b7f193e4cb96fac51ea9b392a7c97bc03c2948cea54f", "ja": "でもステキだと思います♪\n今日から夜風デューサーさんですね！", "zh": "不过我觉得很棒♪  \n从今天起，您就是夜风制作人先生了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "0c8d8dfccbad2324442ef94cbe342fa7811fbd83f78b008dd9278a3199f36017", "ja": "夜風デューサー……ぷっ、ふふっ、あははは……！\nなんだか、肩で風を切ってそう！", "zh": "夜风制作人……噗、呵呵、啊哈哈哈哈……！\n感觉走起路来都带风呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "34d75beaf07f347c8aa9b15e18f36a1851602783a4f1be30073fb3d8f318c9ae", "ja": "紗代子まで、そんな……！", "zh": "怎么连纱代子也这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "a0df17ee01e82a9b0b869a975b80c59be93bc59da9c9910dccb587ecbfcd8e0a", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい、ちょっと……、\nツボに、入っちゃって……ふふっ、ふふふっ！", "zh": "对、对不起，只是有点……戳中笑点了……呵呵，呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "e6187da6118e442d9f54b27206f5c1f2a419b84780ffb167d47e74abcd3bef4a", "ja": "ははっ、別にいいんじゃないか？\nサヨがこんなに笑うの、久しぶりに見れたよ。", "zh": "哈哈，没关系吧？\n好久没见到纱代笑得这么开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "61397669681e4a11913251b74573112253b6012e08e6873db2139ab97f7e30a1", "ja": "確かに！　紗代子ちゃんが、\nもっともっと可愛くなるように、それ～♪", "zh": "确实！为了让纱代子变得越来越可爱，就这样——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "78b38af675ffd3515550615c5ef585957c9f5aebfaa773f332051253f29c8de0", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？　れ、麗花さん、なにを……あんっ！　\nく、くすぐらないでください～～～！", "zh": "呀啊！？丽花姐，你、你要做什么……啊嗯！别、别挠我痒痒～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "6fb8ddacd582bb9aedc901e0239108e0a8bf2b7920002fbaab5536bff1b5a5e5", "ja": "こちょこちょこちょ～っ♪\nえーいっ、ジュリアちゃんも！", "zh": "挠痒痒挠痒痒～♪  \n嘿——！茱莉亚也来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "986bdc988851eac28f02de441951bc1a432d4a671a2a066c7dfbf27e3631fca5", "ja": "うわあ！　や、やめろレイ！\nなんであたしまで……あは、はははは！", "zh": "呜哇！别、别闹了，丽花！\n为什么连我也……啊哈，哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1040_027say", "source_sha256": "aa55c78650caf0c14a45bef325c90b6d65b2323f1651e825327bf72f57430f5a", "ja": "あは、あははははっ！\nちょ、ちょっ、やめ、あっ、あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈，啊哈哈哈哈！\n等、等等，住手，啊、啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "eb8cf3c0200217c12bc83ad6d37907a5da2c9a1097f830e050f864999a8b0c78", "ja": "（夜空の下で、笑いあうアイドルたち……。\nみんな、いい笑顔だな。しっかりと見守っていよう！）", "zh": "（在夜空下欢笑的偶像们……。\n大家笑得真开心啊。我要好好守望着这一幕！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "806d0860baa66e0e34f7da4f49ac9ecad0125169a62543f27b45a0de889f658a", "ja": "見守ってないで止め、あはっ、あははははっ！\nこらっ、バカP、レイ！　やめ……あははははっ！", "zh": "别光看着，快阻止啊，哈哈，啊哈哈哈哈！喂，笨蛋P、玲音！住手……啊哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "46877578733344d7d42e0828b7358168cb60cd9eb81275ceebf408264d89f785", "ja": "はい、おしま～い♪\n……ずっと笑顔、忘れないでね。紗代子ちゃん♪", "zh": "好啦，到此为止～♪  \n……要一直保持笑容哦，纱代子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1044_027say", "source_sha256": "0b4c446e5f742a706cb1d874e7f225c2f404bca2e2f618f6dc21207e4b37e40e", "ja": "はあ、はあ、はぁ……んもうっ、麗花さん！\nいい感じの台詞で、ごまかさないでくださいっ！", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……真是的，丽花姐！\n别用这么漂亮的台词来糊弄我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1045_048rei", "source_sha256": "2d020c13448e9298b2845d80568a53bff92fc7b0fc7715aee48261858096ee35", "ja": "ふふっ、ごめんなさーい♪　てへぺろりん♪", "zh": "呵呵，对不起啦♪　嘿嘿，吐舌头♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "ad6ea6ce1c8872c791c8975af1df74ca0e9ab2b175b926571807353af7ab51af", "ja": "くう……、お……、覚えてろ……よ！", "zh": "呜……你……你给我等着……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "33372d1bf8bf0cd7d1be27032f3e4736181a9dfeb898b03a200d896f94137607", "ja": "（紗代子も元気になったみたいだし、来てよかった。\n明日からまた、気分を新たに頑張れそうだ！）", "zh": "（纱代子好像也打起精神来了，看来这次来得很值得。从明天开始，也能重新振作起来好好努力了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
